# ==============================================================================
# Purpose: Ignorar artefactos locales de build/deploy para que nunca se
#   commiteen (GeneXus outputs, ZIPs, backups, temporales Windows/Jenkins).
# Description: .gitignore del pipeline GeneXus .NET sobre IIS (REQ-005).
# Author: SDD implementer (REQ-005 pipeline-quality)
# Usage: Automatico via `git status`; verificar con `git status --porcelain`
#   tras generar un *.zip (no debe listarse).
# Dependencies: git
# ==============================================================================

# --- GeneXus build outputs ---
*.zip
Backup-*.zip
*.gxdproj.user
*.suo
*.user
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Dd]eploy/LOCAL/
GxGerman/
web/bin/

# --- Backups locales ---
*.bak
*.tmp
*.orig
*~

# --- Jenkins ---
.jenkins/
jenkins.war
*.jpi
*.hpi

# --- Windows ---
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.lnk

# --- Editor / OS ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
